@startuml btrie-hybrid-bucket
' ============================================================================
' btrie-hybrid-bucket.puml — a hybrid bucket B^H: MANY parent slots in range
' [l,u] converge on one bucket; the leading char is kept (distinguishes strings).
' Source: docs/theory/disk-tries/02-b-trie.md (Askitis & Zobel 2009), § Bucket Types.
' Color key:  blue  #BBDEFB  parent-trie slots in the range ['a','n']
'             grey  #ECEFF1  elision of the middle slots
'             green #C8E6C9  the shared hybrid bucket
' ============================================================================
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #37474F
  FontColor #212121
  BorderThickness 1.2
}
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam TitleFontSize 15

title Hybrid bucket B^H(ε, 'a', 'n') — many routes converge on one bucket

rectangle "slot **[a]**" as SA #BBDEFB
rectangle "slot **[b]**" as SB #BBDEFB
rectangle "**…**" as SD #ECEFF1
rectangle "slot **[n]**" as SN #BBDEFB
rectangle "**Hybrid Bucket  B^H(ε, 'a', 'n')**\nrange ['a', 'n'] · prefix consumed = ε (empty)\n────────────\n'apple'    (lead char 'a')\n'banana'   (lead char 'b')\n'mango'    (lead char 'm')\nleading char NOT removed — needed to tell strings apart" as HB #C8E6C9

SA -[hidden]right- SB
SB -[hidden]right- SD
SD -[hidden]right- SN

SA --> HB
SB --> HB
SD --> HB
SN --> HB

legend bottom
  All parent slots in [l, u] point here · a split grows the trie **horizontally**.
endlegend
@enduml
